00:19:59.980 --> 00:20:05.080
Follow and listen to the We Do Not Care Club podcast with Melanie Sanders wherever you get your podcaSt.
在各大播客平台搜索并收听由梅兰妮·桑德斯主持的“我们不在乎俱乐部”播客。

511
00:20:05.080 --> 00:20:11.160
All right, you guys, we are back.
好了，各位，我们回来了。

512
00:20:11.420 --> 00:20:15.060
Michael is holding court, finally, in the kitchen.
迈克尔终于在厨房里掌控全场了。

