00:20:34.460 --> 00:20:39.660
I will tell you, Jenna, Angela Martin is wearing a purple turtleneck and a purple cardigan.
我来告诉你，珍娜，安吉拉·马丁穿着紫色的高领毛衣和紫色的开衫。

