00:20:42.680 --> 00:20:45.160
Kelly is wearing a purple striped button-down shirt.
凯莉穿着一件紫色条纹的衬衫。

520
00:20:45.460 --> 00:20:49.700
Oscar has purple squares on his tie and sort of faint purple stripes on his shirt.
奥斯卡领带上有紫色的方块，衬衫上有点淡淡的紫色条纹。

521
00:20:50.040 --> 00:20:53.920
Stanley has purple stripes on his shirt and purple flowers on his tie.
斯坦利的衬衫上有紫色条纹，领带上有紫色的花朵。

