00:25:17.020 --> 00:25:18.820
And he's going to stop worrying about calories.
然后他就不打算再为卡路里操心了。

615
00:25:19.300 --> 00:25:26.720
So during this whole montage of, like, people giving Michael advice, there was a scene in the shooting draft that didn't make it.
所以在这一整段大家给迈克尔提建议的剪辑中，拍摄剧本里其实有一个场景没能播出来。

616
00:25:27.560 --> 00:25:30.540
