1094
00:45:47.330 --> 00:45:47.630
Yeah.
对。

1095
00:45:47.930 --> 00:45:50.070
So I think Paul likes those interesting shots.
所以我猜保罗挺喜欢那些有趣的镜头的。

1096
00:45:50.790 --> 00:45:53.030
In the next scene, Michael goes up to Pam.
在下一场戏中，迈克尔走向潘。

