The post-it is still there.
那个便签还在那儿。

1117
00:46:51.790 --> 00:46:54.610
Nick has been in the office for three episodes now.
尼克已经连续三集都在办公室了。

1118
00:46:54.810 --> 00:46:55.330
Nick in office.
尼克在办公室。

1119
00:46:55.330 --> 00:46:55.450
All day.
整天。

1120
00:46:55.670 --> 00:46:55.790
Yeah.
是啊。

1121
00:46:56.090 --> 00:46:56.690
Nick in office.
尼克在办公室。

1122
00:46:57.190 --> 00:46:57.730
All right.
行吧。

1123
00:46:57.850 --> 00:47:01.390
Now we're going to get into this really wonderful scene in the conference room.
现在我们要进入会议室里这个非常精彩的场景。

