The Angela-Kelly rivalry is going strong.
安吉拉和凯莉的竞争正酣。

1125
00:47:05.350 --> 00:47:10.210
Kelly is talking to Charles about how she has to leave early on Tuesdays to pick up her little
凯莉正在跟查尔斯说她周二必须提前离开去接她的小

1126
00:47:10.210 --> 00:47:13.510
