Well, you remember he has a degree in accounting.
好吧，你记得他有会计学位。

1131
00:47:23.630 --> 00:47:28.090
Charles is like, did Michael just allow anyone in his office at any time?
查尔斯好像在说，迈克尔以前就允许任何人随时进他办公室吗？

1132
00:47:28.610 --> 00:47:29.010
Okay.
好吧。

1133
00:47:29.230 --> 00:47:30.450
So this was in the script.
所以这段是在剧本里的。

1134
