我查了一下，看看有多少是即兴发挥，有多少不是。

1135
00:47:33.710 --> 00:47:36.950
And there was a prompt for Angela and Kelly to talk at the same time.
剧本提示安吉拉和Kelly同时说话。

1136
00:47:37.190 --> 00:47:41.890
And we did add a little bit more, but basically we both just were going to gush like, oh,
我们确实加了一点内容，但基本上我们俩就是一阵吹捧，比如，哦，

1137
00:47:42.010 --> 00:47:43.030
yeah, he was like, come on in.
对，他当时说，请进。

1138
00:47:43.310 --> 00:47:45.710
I felt like this was super animated, Angela.
我觉得这超级生动，安吉拉。

1139
00:47:46.630 --> 00:47:52.350
Well, you know, she is turning on the charm for Mr. Charles Minor.
嗯，你知道的，她在对查尔斯·迈纳先生使出浑身解数。

1140
00:47:52.610 --> 00:47:53.090
I know.
我知道。

1141
00:47:53.090 --> 00:47:57.370
She said there was a Sunday bar at the accounting seminar, but she didn't eat any, you know,
她说会计研讨会上有一个周日酒吧，但她什么都没吃，为了

1142
00:47:57.370 --> 00:47:58.130
