保持身材。

1143
00:47:58.330 --> 00:48:04.370
And then Kelly shoos her out and turns to Charles and says, yeah, she's really special.
然后凯莉把她赶了出去，转向查尔斯说，是啊，她真的很特别。

1144
00:48:04.490 --> 00:48:06.590
You know, she's turning 50 this year.
你知道的，她今年50岁了。

1145
00:48:07.650 --> 00:48:10.770
I was actually 37 when we filmed this.
拍这场戏时我其实37岁。

1146
00:48:10.870 --> 00:48:12.310
I am 50 now.
我现在50岁了。

1147
00:48:14.110 --> 00:48:20.870
You know, when we were trading messages with Aaron Shore, he wrote us about a prank that Idris
你知道，当我们和亚伦·肖尔发信息时，他写信告诉我们伊德瑞斯

